Package: lrd-adapt-common
Version: 1.0.0
Architecture: arm64
Maintainer: LibreDroid <adapt@lrd.local>
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Depends: libhybris, libhybris-utils, systemd, udev, kmod, jq
Recommends: cage, chromium, pulseaudio, pulseaudio-modules-droid, ofono
Suggests: sshd
Conflicts: lrd-adapt-legacy
Description: LibreDroid adaptation runtime
 Turns the per-device adaptation config into a live stack: libhybris property
 and environment setup, display backend selection, vendor module loading,
 audio and radio wiring, and the boot gate.
 .
 Every step records whether it actually succeeded, so the shell can report a
 real tier instead of assuming one.
